---
import Layout from "../../layouts/Home.astro";
import "../../styles/software.css";

const seo = {
  title: "Software | A Pusok",
  description: "Software",
};
---

<Layout {seo} pageClass="software-page">
  <div class="software-wrap" id="software-top">
    <div class="software-heading"><h1>Software</h1></div>
    <div class="software-list">
      <article
        class="software-card software-card--primary"
        aria-labelledby="fd-pde-title"
      >
        <div class="software-copy">
          <p class="software-role">Primary development of</p>
          <h2 class="software-name" id="fd-pde-title">FD-PDE Framework</h2>
          <ul class="software-details">
            <li>
              The FD-PDE framework uses finite difference staggered grids for
              solving partial differential equations (PDEs) for
              single-/two-phase flow magma dynamics and other applications in
              geodynamics.
            </li>
            <li>
              The framework is based on <a
                class="a_theme"
                target="_blank"
                href="https://petsc.org/release/">PETSc</a
              >. Governing equations are discretized as object PDEs (i.e., FDPDE
              Type), and the user only specifies coefficients, constitutive
              equations, and boundary conditions.
            </li>
            <li>
              Models: mid-ocean ridge dynamics, melt extraction, small-scale
              convection.
            </li>
          </ul>
          <a
            class="repository-link"
            href="https://github.com/apusok/FD-PDE/"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
            aria-label="Github repository: FD-PDE Framework"
            ><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true"
              ><path
                d="M12 .75a11.25 11.25 0 0 0-3.558 21.923c.563.104.77-.244.77-.542 0-.267-.01-1.153-.015-2.09-3.133.68-3.794-1.328-3.794-1.328-.512-1.3-1.25-1.646-1.25-1.646-1.022-.7.078-.686.078-.686 1.13.08 1.725 1.16 1.725 1.16 1.005 1.724 2.638 1.225 3.28.937.101-.728.393-1.226.715-1.508-2.5-.285-5.13-1.25-5.13-5.564 0-1.23.44-2.234 1.159-3.023-.116-.284-.502-1.43.11-2.98 0 0 .945-.303 3.094 1.155A10.79 10.79 0 0 1 12 6.18c.956.005 1.919.129 2.818.38 2.147-1.458 3.09-1.155 3.09-1.155.614 1.55.228 2.696.113 2.98.72.79 1.157 1.794 1.157 3.023 0 4.326-2.635 5.276-5.144 5.555.404.35.765 1.04.765 2.098 0 1.516-.014 2.736-.014 3.108 0 .3.203.65.773.54A11.252 11.252 0 0 0 12 .75z"
              ></path></svg
            ><span>Github repository</span><svg
              class="repository-arrow"
              viewBox="0 0 24 24"
              fill="none"
              stroke="currentColor"
              stroke-width="1.6"
              aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14m-6-6 6 6-6 6"></path></svg
            ></a
          >
        </div>
        <figure class="software-visual">
          <img
            src="/assets/img/logo_cmap2.png"
            alt="author"
            width="2032"
            height="1142"
          />
        </figure>
      </article>
      <article class="software-card" aria-labelledby="lamem-title">
        <div class="software-copy">
          <p class="software-role">Contributed to the development of</p>
          <h2 class="software-name" id="lamem-title">LaMEM</h2>
          <ul class="software-details">
            <li>
              LaMEM (Lithosphere and Mantle Evolution Model) is a fast, parallel
              3D numerical code for thermo-mechanical geodynamics problems with
              visco-elasto-plastic rheologies.
            </li>
            <li>
              LaMEM is also based on <a
                class="a_theme"
                target="_blank"
                href="https://petsc.org/release/">PETSc</a
              >.
            </li>
          </ul>
          <a
            class="repository-link"
            href="https://github.com/UniMainzGeo/LaMEM"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
            aria-label="Github repository: LaMEM"
            ><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true"
              ><path
                d="M12 .75a11.25 11.25 0 0 0-3.558 21.923c.563.104.77-.244.77-.542 0-.267-.01-1.153-.015-2.09-3.133.68-3.794-1.328-3.794-1.328-.512-1.3-1.25-1.646-1.25-1.646-1.022-.7.078-.686.078-.686 1.13.08 1.725 1.16 1.725 1.16 1.005 1.724 2.638 1.225 3.28.937.101-.728.393-1.226.715-1.508-2.5-.285-5.13-1.25-5.13-5.564 0-1.23.44-2.234 1.159-3.023-.116-.284-.502-1.43.11-2.98 0 0 .945-.303 3.094 1.155A10.79 10.79 0 0 1 12 6.18c.956.005 1.919.129 2.818.38 2.147-1.458 3.09-1.155 3.09-1.155.614 1.55.228 2.696.113 2.98.72.79 1.157 1.794 1.157 3.023 0 4.326-2.635 5.276-5.144 5.555.404.35.765 1.04.765 2.098 0 1.516-.014 2.736-.014 3.108 0 .3.203.65.773.54A11.252 11.252 0 0 0 12 .75z"
              ></path></svg
            ><span>Github repository</span><svg
              class="repository-arrow"
              viewBox="0 0 24 24"
              fill="none"
              stroke="currentColor"
              stroke-width="1.6"
              aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14m-6-6 6 6-6 6"></path></svg
            ></a
          >
        </div>
        <figure class="software-visual">
          <img
            src="/assets/img/logo_cmap3.png"
            alt="author"
            width="2032"
            height="1142"
          />
        </figure>
      </article>
    </div>
    <div class="software-actions">
      <a class="return-home" href="/"
        ><svg
          viewBox="0 0 24 24"
          fill="none"
          stroke="currentColor"
          stroke-width="1.6"
          aria-hidden="true"><path d="M19 12H5m6-6-6 6 6 6"></path></svg
        >Return Home</a
      >
      <a class="back-top" href="#software-top">Back to top ↑</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
